{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tsPCO5VO921793596060.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>漁護署與中大珊瑚學院合作，將30株珊瑚移植至海下灣海岸公園，紀念公園成立30周年。</p><p></p><p>儀式早上在中大李福善海洋科學研究中心舉行。環境及生態局局長謝展寰、漁護署署長黎堅明等出席。他們在30株幼年珊瑚的底座寫上祝福語，寄望健康成長，之後轉移到玻璃缸。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CORAL-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xIkM71NMcI1793596051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>30株珊瑚涵蓋三個本地物種，分別是鹿角珊瑚、風潮珊瑚和扁腦珊瑚，由中大珊瑚學院基地用一至三年培育。中大團隊指珊瑚移植到大海後，能注入更多基因多樣性，令珊瑚更有韌性，抵禦氣候變化帶來的極端天氣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.925101+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:30.882589+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:29.267362+00:00","content_hash":"dac74f55a8924d51fbc05cf9ddf3b4da3f150e496341f39fd7d3e3d4d7909d52","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.925101+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}